    delphi:domain <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/domain/delphisci-swarm-methods> ;
    rdfs:comment "UNSIGNED DRAFT. Not signed, not published to any registry (test or production). The key owner decides who signs and under which identity; the human owner below is a placeholder until then; the commit hash of swarm/PREREG.md must be added to the evidence before signing. Remove this statement when signing." , "Template note: this record is hand-authored in Delphi ontology v2.0 terms (delphi:) as the delphi skill requires, and declares no assertion template. The template that would otherwise apply, https://w3id.org/np/RAI0QFH7bCNJIeKxwG3EbX5QKyoOjlaESiJkVZKs8iUc8 (\"Project Delphi claim\", 2026-10-23, checked 2026-10-31), states its statements with legacy probknow (pk:) IRIs (11 pk: term uses, 0 delphi: IRIs), so this record cannot have been created from it and does not say it was. The label/domain publication-info template https://w3id.org/np/RAtKj9bCnB4gUe0E9k-WhffQFSEWd9Ve2hrVllYoLuOB0 is not declared either (2 pk: uses; its domain field is a probknow resource prefix). Decision recorded in swarm/nanopubs/DECISIONS.md, 2026-10-31; see record delphisci-swarm-04." ;
    nt:wasCreatedFromProvenanceTemplate <https://w3id.org/np/RAaYeFYF-Cz2bM5S1wPQsnvs5X6BBxsphL03UkbVZ1lcA> ;
    nt:wasCreatedFromPubinfoTemplate <https://w3id.org/np/RAukAcWHRDlkqxk7H2XNSegc1WnHI569INvNr-xdptDGI> , <https://w3id.org/np/RACJ58Gvyn91LqCKIO9zu1eijDQIeEff28iyDrJgjSJF8> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/domain/delphisci-swarm-methods> rdfs:label "delphisci-swarm-methods" .
}
